<Mod id="8dac91b6-191b-4698-b762-0256963343ac" version="3">
  <Properties>
    <Name>!Jarcast's The Navajo for VP</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds the native American civilization of [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]The Navajo[ENDCOLOR] under Manuelito to the game.</Teaser>
    <Description>[ICON_BULLET]UA - Hozhooji
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]UGP - Hataali (GProphet)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]UI - Hogan (Village)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]UU - Naabaahii (Cuirassier)
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]UB - Diyogi At'looh (Workshop)</Description>
    <Authors>Jarcast, grant</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Asterix Rage, Hokath</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <Homepage>https://forums.civfanatics.com/threads/jarcasts-the-navajo-for-vp.697099/</Homepage>
